<td>Iron chest containing one SA-18 &quot;Grouse&quot; man-portable surface-to-air missile. Warhead is constructed of precious materials in style of Peter Carl Fabergé. Payload has been replaced by one 4&#160;cm iron needle suspended in empty canister.</td>
